WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.019
In this video, you will find homes that a professional lighting company installed, and look at the company behind them.

00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:08.123
We start on the map.

00:00:09.023 --> 00:00:10.772
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.711 --> 00:00:16.228
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.027 --> 00:00:19.008
Then tap Allow.

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:23.698
Tap the season button.

00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:27.522
Pick the one you want.

00:00:27.522 --> 00:00:31.604
Christmas lights are the biggest, so tap Thanksgiving and Christmas Lights.

00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:36.723
Halloween, New Year, and other seasons are in the same list.

00:00:37.622 --> 00:00:38.689
Tap Filters.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.928
Under Type, tap Professionally installed.

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:51.177
This shows only homes that a lighting company put up, which is great if you are thinking of hiring one for your own home.

00:00:52.077 --> 00:00:56.301
Tap the button at the bottom, Show places, with the number of places it found.

00:00:58.283 --> 00:00:59.784
Open one of the places.

00:00:59.784 --> 00:01:02.725
It says Installed by, with the company's name.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:05.728
A check mark means the company has confirmed it.

00:01:07.803 --> 00:01:10.213
Tap the company's name to open its profile.

00:01:12.264 --> 00:01:13.978
This is the company's profile.

00:01:13.978 --> 00:01:22.270
It lists where they work, their phone number, and their website, along with every home they have installed, so you can see their work before you call.

00:01:23.469 --> 00:01:25.752
Next up: Enter your home in a contest.
